@startuml
actor User
boundary "app.py (UI)" as UI
control "load_dataset()" as Cache
entity "data_twitter_terlabeli.xlsx" as DB
boundary "Plotly / Wordcloud Engine" as Vis

User -> UI : Pilih menu 'Ringkasan Dataset'
activate UI

UI -> Cache : Panggil load_dataset()
activate Cache

Cache -> DB : Baca file Excel
activate DB
DB --> Cache : Return DataFrame
deactivate DB

Cache --> UI : Return Cached DataFrame
deactivate Cache

UI -> UI : Hitung jumlah label Positif & Negatif

UI -> Vis : Generate Bar/Pie Chart
activate Vis
Vis --> UI : Return chart object
deactivate Vis

UI -> Vis : Generate Wordcloud (cleaned_text)
activate Vis
Vis --> UI : Return wordcloud image
deactivate Vis

UI --> User : Tampilkan Charts & Wordcloud
deactivate UI
@endum
